For Japanese features of an hour or more, see [JAV Movies](/channel/jav-movies) and the [Japanese](/category/japanese) category. Each video page lists the cast, tags and runtime, and the video plays from its source site.', now()),
  ('adult-time', 'Watch free Adult Time scenes on VEXN: full-length studio scenes from the Adult Time streaming network, most of them 20 minutes or longer and led by well-known pornstars.

